              <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Front_(military)>;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """A military front or battlefront is a contested armed frontier between opposing forces. This can be a local or tactical front, or it can range to a theater. A typical front was the Western Front in France and Belgium in World War I. The term \"home front\" has been used to denote conditions in the civilian sector of a country at war, including those involved in the production of matériel."""@en;
