                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs> <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Midshipman>;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A midshipman is an officer cadet, or a commissioned officer of the lowest rank, in the Royal Navy, United States Navy, and many Commonwealth navies. Commonwealth countries which use the rank include Australia, New Zealand, South Africa, Pakistan, India, Singapore, Sri Lanka and Kenya. The rank was also used, prior to 1968, by the Royal Canadian Navy, but upon the creation of the Canadian Forces the rank of midshipman was replaced with the rank of naval cadet."@en;
