                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sangsa is a Korean military rank used by both the armed forces of North and South Korea. A Sangsa is the equivalent to a First Sergeant in most other militaries. The rank of Sangsa is junior to a Wonsa in South Korea and to a Warrant Officer like rank in the North known as Teukmu Sangsa."@en;
