mil:Rank_Vice-Admiral_of_the_Coast <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> mil:datasetdefinition;
                                   a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
                                     mil:MilitaryRank;
