mil:toUnit <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> mil:datasetdefinition;
           a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
             <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DeprecatedProperty>;
           rdfs:domain mil:PostToUnit;
           rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://rdf.muninn-project.org/ontologies/military>;
           rdfs:label "To Unit"@en;
           rdfs:range mil:MilitaryRank;
           <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentProperty> <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#unitOf>.
<http://rdf.muninn-project.org/ontologies/parentUnit> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> mil:datasetdefinition;
                                                      a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
